<div class="space-y-4">
  <div class="gw-window gw-frame p-6 leading-relaxed">
    <%= render 'documentation/breadcrumb', page: 'Automated Tournament Commands' %>

    <h1 class="font-display text-gold-300 text-2xl tracking-wide m-0 mt-3">Automated Tournament Commands</h1>
    <p class="text-muted mt-1 mb-0">Manage daily Automated Tournament registration</p>

    <div class="flex gap-6 mt-6">
      <%= render 'documentation/sidebar' %>
      <div class="flex-1 min-w-0 gw-doc">
        <h2>Command Reference</h2>

        <div class="mb-5 space-y-1">
          <h3>/at schedule</h3>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Description:</strong> Set which daily AT slot (a/b/c) this server tracks</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Usage:</strong> <code>/at schedule &lt;a|b|c&gt;</code></p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Example:</strong> <code>/at schedule a</code></p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Response:</strong> <code>&lt;@user&gt;, this server now tracks AT slot **a**; reminders will post in this channel. Next AT: &lt;date&gt;.</code></p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-5 space-y-1">
          <h3>/at next</h3>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Description:</strong> Show time until the next scheduled AT and registration window status</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Usage:</strong> <code>/at next</code></p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Response:</strong> <code>&lt;@user&gt;, the next AT (slot A) starts in 2h 30m (&lt;date&gt;).</code></p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-5 space-y-1">
          <h3>/at join</h3>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Description:</strong> Post the Automated Tournament registration panel</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Usage:</strong> <code>/at join</code></p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Response:</strong> Posts an interactive panel with Register/Unregister buttons</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-5 space-y-1">
          <h3>/at players</h3>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Description:</strong> List players in the current AT queue</p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Usage:</strong> <code>/at players</code></p>
          <p class="m-0"><strong>Response:</strong></p>
          <pre class="bg-[#100b05] border border-gold-600/50 rounded p-3 overflow-x-auto text-sm">&lt;@user&gt;, the current AT queue players for this server are:
#1 &lt;@player1&gt; (**IGN1**)
#2 &lt;@player2&gt; (**IGN2**)
...
Team is full! (8 players)</pre>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8">
          <h2>Related Pages</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><%= link_to 'View all tournaments', tournaments_path %></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
